    "lawCode": "Amd §5, Chap 672 of 1993",
    "lawSection": "Public Authorities",
    "memo": "\n \nBILL NUMBER: S8084A\n\nSPONSOR: FUNKE\n \nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act to amend chapter 672 of the laws of 1993, amending the public\nauthorities law relating to the construction and financing of facilities\nfor certain public libraries, in relation to including the Victor Farm-\nington Library\n\n \nPURPOSE OR GENERAL IDEA OF BILL:\n\nTo allow for the financing of construction projects for the Victor Farm-\nington Library by the New York State Dormitory Authority\n\n \nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\n\nSection 1 - Authorizes the Victor Farmington Library to participate in\nfinancing offered by the Dormitory Authority of the State of New York\n\nSection 2 - Sets forth the effective date\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nThe Victor Farmington Library requested this legislation to assist them\nas they move forward with major renovations and new construction. If\nsuccessful their participation in DASNY financing will provide stability\nto the project and save taxpayers money on interest when compared with a\nprivate sector loan.\n\n \nPRIOR LEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\nThis is a new bill\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nNone.\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nImmediately\n",
